  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE30.37 fn6",
      "summary": "Footnote 6 of CRE30.37 sends the domestic-exposure maturity exemption to CRE32.44, but it is in CRE32.45.",
      "impact": "Position: A-IRB bank, domestic corporate group sales and assets EUR 300m Reading a: Follow footnote to CRE32.44: no exemption found, must measure M Reading b: Follow CRE32.45: supervisor may allow fixed 2.5 years Difference: Measured M vs 2.5 fixed",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
